# L §7.2: the step of a round is positive (an input "whose every value is positive"); L §8.4: a step that isn't
# positive is refused at the key (RUN-DOMAIN).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input x: money PLN
input st: money PLN
def c: money PLN = round(x, st, half-up) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x = 10.00
  st = 0.00

ask q: c law 2026-06-30
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-DOMAIN ...
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
